/extras/5aac63804a88f483b6ecbeef4a5d08ad.mp4?t=1706594459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    \u26ac This is a police-only skill.<br>    \u26ac Take the police car and move two spaces.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>assistant</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/a378c1c6e3f939b7124e6ab102c377c9.poster.avif?t=1706594459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/a378c1c6e3f939b7124e6ab102c377c9.webm?t=1706594459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/a378c1c6e3f939b7124e6ab102c377c9.mp4?t=1706594459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    \u26ac This is a police-only skill.<br>    \u26ac You can select one of the fraudster tiles to investigate.<br><br>\u2022 <strong>call</strong><br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/05655c573caab0dcb7f3be6830c10cd7.poster.avif?t=1706594459\" width=600 height=338 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/05655c573caab0dcb7f3be6830c10cd7.webm?t=1706594459\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/2709980/extras/05655c573caab0dcb7f3be6830c10cd7.mp4?t=1706594459\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><br>    \u26ac This is a police-only skill.<br>    \u26ac Nominate a fellow police officer and call him to the tile adjacent to me.",
